# Google Sign-In (optional).
#
# Enabled only when NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID is set to a non-empty value.
# Leave these commented out to hide the Google button entirely.
#
# Both values must be the SAME client ID. The public one is used by the browser
# button, the private one is used by the server to verify the token audience.
# No client secret is needed - Google ID tokens are verified against Google's
# published JWKS endpoint.
#
# Create a client at: console.cloud.google.com -> project -> APIs & Services
# -> Credentials -> Create credentials -> OAuth client ID -> Web application
# -> Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:3000

# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
